IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LATENCY-DECOMP.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TTFT-MS             PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DECODE-TOTAL-MS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 OUTPUT-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 TPOT-MS             PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 TOTAL-LATENCY-MS    PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LATENCY-DECOMP.
    IF OUTPUT-LEN == 0
        MOVE 1 TO OUTPUT-LEN.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE TPOT-MS = DECODE-TOTAL-MS / OUTPUT-LEN.
    COMPUTE TOTAL-LATENCY-MS = TTFT-MS + DECODE-TOTAL-MS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-LATENCY-MS.
    WEIGHT 30 TPOT-MS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 25.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
